## Quick Launch (Windows)

The easiest way to run and manage VoteMaster is via the interactive launcher:

1. Navigate to `VoteMaster/VoteMaster Launcher/`.
2. Double-click **`Launch-VoteMaster.bat`**.
3. A **VoteMaster Launcher** shortcut will automatically be created on your Desktop for convenient one-click access (or press `Ctrl + Alt + V`).
